# Text files are stored and checked out with LF everywhere.
#
# The protocol pages are generated, and the check that guards them compares the
# generated bytes with the committed ones. A checkout that converted them to
# CRLF would make that check fail on Windows for a reason that has nothing to
# do with the registry.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
